msgstr "Déanfar an bosca dúisithe a iompú isteach i fuireachas tar éis dúiseacht allmhairiú uathoibríoch EPG."

msgid "This is for advanced users that are using the channel id filtering feature. If enabled, the filter rules defined into /etc/epgimport/channel_id_filter.conf will also be applied on your /etc/epgimport/custom.channels.xml file."
msgstr "Tá sé seo le haghaidh úsáideoirí ardleibhéil atá ag baint úsáide as an ngné scagtha aitheantais cainéal. Má tá sé cumasaithe, cuirfear na rialacha scagaire atá sainmhínithe i /etc/epgimport/channel_id_filter.conf i bhfeidhm freisin ar do chomhad /etc/epgimport/custom.channels.xml."

msgid "This will clear the current EPG data in memory before updating the EPG data. This allows you to always have a clean new EPG with the latest EPG data, for example in case of program changes between refresh, otherwise EPG data are cumulative."
msgstr "Glanfaidh sé seo na sonraí EPG reatha sa chuimhne sula nuashonrófar na sonraí EPG. Ligeann sé seo duit EPG nua glan a bheith agat i gcónaí leis na sonraí EPG is déanaí, mar shampla i gcás athruithe clár idir athnuachan, nó beidh sonraí EPG carnach."

msgid "This will turn back waked up box into deep-standby after automatic EPG import."
msgstr "Cuirfidh sé seo an bosca dúisithe ar ais go cúltaca domhain tar éis allmhairiú uathoibríoch EPG."

msgid "Thursday"
msgstr "Déardaoin"

msgid "To save memory you can decide to load EPG data only  for theIPTV channels."
