msgid "To save memory you can decide to only load EPG data for the services that you have in your bouquet files."
msgstr "Chun cuimhne a shábháil is féidir leat cinneadh a dhéanamh gan ach sonraí EPG a luchtú le haghaidh na seirbhísí atá agat i do chomhaid bouquet."

